work.gemini_prompt:
The user {{displayName}} is working at their company. Create a realistic challenge based on the following information:

Company name: {{companyName}}
Description: {{companyDescription}}
Difficulty: {{difficulty}} (1 = very easy, 10 = very hard)
Employee expectations: {{expectations}}

Generate a simulation of a situation that could occur in the daily work, according to the difficulty level. The situation should require the user to say how they would react. This is not an interview question.

Return only the question, without explanations, without quotes and without additional comments.
Example format (do not reproduce the example below):
A customer got angry with the service because [reason] and expects you to resolve it.
